' 04-pipeline-state.puml — PipelineState transitions
' For: docs/architecture/04-pipeline-flow.md
' Last revised: 2026-04-30
'
' PipelineState literals from src/spectra/entities/enums.py plus the
' Q2-designed budget-exceeded transition.

@startuml
title PipelineState — lifecycle transitions

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #7C3AED
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4C1D95
  ArrowColor #7C3AED
}

[*] --> pending : process start

pending --> ingesting : analyze_repository entered

ingesting --> failed : SPEC-001 git clone failed (exhausted retries)
ingesting --> meta_prompting : workspace prepared\n(includes Stage 1.5 PREFLIGHT)

meta_prompting --> failed : SPEC-002 / 005 / 006 from MetaPrompter
meta_prompting --> analyzing : plan JSON parsed
meta_prompting --> reporting : Phase 2 cache HIT\n(short-circuit)

analyzing --> degraded : 2+ specialists failed\n(SPEC-007 — partial report)
analyzing --> merging : 0-1 failures

merging --> critiquing : critique enabled\n(not --quick, not degraded)
merging --> reporting : critique skipped

critiquing --> compromised : ADR-011 — rule_id\nSPEC-PROMPT-INJECTION-DETECTED emitted
critiquing --> reporting : critique complete\n(filtered + insights)
critiquing --> reporting : SPEC-008 critique failed\n(unmodified findings, logged)

reporting --> complete : HTML/JSON/SARIF emitted
reporting --> failed : SPEC-009 render failed

degraded --> reporting : assemble partial report
compromised --> reporting : banner + Q2-designed\nrefuse public-mode emission

complete --> [*]
degraded --> [*]
compromised --> [*]
failed --> [*]

note right of compromised #FEE2E2
  Terminal — public-mode emission
  refuses to publish a grade (Q2).
end note

note right of degraded #FEF3C7
  ≥2 specialists failed; pipeline still
  produces a partial report so the
  human reviewer can act on what works.
end note

' Q2 designed transition
state "budget_exceeded" as be #9CA3AF
analyzing --> be : --max-cost-usd reached\n(Q2 designed — ADR-013)
critiquing --> be : --max-cost-usd reached
be --> reporting : Q2 — emit "budget exceeded" report

@enduml
